    {
      "Name": "French Kweebec",
      "Line": "I am not asking of you to go that far. I simply wish for you to not be un courrier for someone who ...",
      "Sprite":"sprites/Kweebec_French_Sad.png"
    },
    {
      "Name": "Narrator",
      "Line": "He is, again, unable to find the right words for some time.",
      "Sprite":"sprites/Kweebec_French_Sad.png"
    },
    {
      "Name": "French Kweebec",
      "Line": "It is best if we find something else to talk about, oui ? I should have suggested something instead of letting the doubt set in.",
      "Sprite":"sprites/Kweebec_French_Happy.png"
    }
  ],
